# ui-restore

When the user wants to restore UI from design images into a Vue project:

1. Use the `ui-restore` CLI (`pnpm ui-restore` from repo root after `pnpm build`).
2. Never skip the fixed UI JSON DSL; do not treat raw model Vue as the final architecture path.
3. Follow `docs/AGENT.md` and `.cursor/skills/ui-restore/SKILL.md`.

Typical mapping:

- 「恢复登录页」→ `ui-restore restore --cwd <project> login.png`
- 「多图抽公共组件」→ `ui-restore restore` with multiple images
- 「自动修正」→ `ui-restore autofix <pageId> --reference <img>`
